Interchange StudentCohort [2528]
    documentation 'Cohorts are used to designate groups of students outside of class rosters, 
                  'enrollment lists, or program participation.
                  '
                  'The Student Cohort interchange describes student cohort information. It can be 
                  'used to exchange information regarding any named group of students, or cohort, 
                  'for tracking, analysis, or intervention.
    element Cohort [2528-001]
    element StudentCohortAssociation [2528-002]
    element StaffCohortAssociation [2528-003]